message: "If you use Medichain in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "Medichain"
abstract: >-
  A role-based platform for AI-assisted medical imaging reports. Clinicians review and sign
  AI findings, patients own and share their records, and every report is encrypted on IPFS and
  verifiable on an EVM blockchain.
